        "Then execute actual UI events: create/import project, edit typed element/name, validate, save, reload page, close/open, restart backend and reconnect without manual JSON reimport.",
        "Compare resource/semantic identities, names, references, representations, revisions, migration state and downloaded/freshly reopened bytes against an independent expected project.",
        "Retain cancellation, late failures, stale/foreign commands, no-overwrite and failure-evidence custody. Preserve native/Rust long-name and Unicode cases without shrinking them."
